[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0010","text":"────啊，ALSTROEMERIA的……\n大、大崎甜花……的说！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0020","text":"…………啊呜……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0030","text":"差一点……！\n甜花，下次一定能行的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0040","text":"嗯、嗯……\n再来一次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0050","text":"……ALSTROEMERIA的、\n大崎甜花……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0060","text":"哦哦！\n做到了呢，甜花……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0070","text":"嘿嘿……\n做到了……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0080","text":"甜花……\n这样一来，又向偶像……迈进了一步……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0090","text":"哈哈，没错！\n那接下来换个模式练习吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_02_0100","text":"嗯……！　请多关照……的说……！\n…………啊……"}]
